{"case": "2024-BMO1-Q3-authored-false-step", "sourceSha256": "7f181c935d4f818675d355d8549a6375b386787945fe3cbe1f66a88b807be59d", "counterexample": "取 N=8，a=2，b=4。它们是不同的正整数，ab=8，且 N>1 为偶数；但 a,b 都是偶数，并非一奇一偶，且 |a-b|=2 是偶数而非奇数。因此原第二步的一般断言为假。", "kernelVerified": true, "certificateChecked": true, "statementMatched": true, "additionalAxioms": [], "diagnostics": [], "proofSha256": "fa49c1eb1c05d5d3275e04cfd177fc1a3abe604f0278f5a3e84991d06e1740cd", "note": "Proves formal negation of the claimed inference, not entire user's proof or source correspondence."}
